  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Capwn.jpg\" title=\"Capwn\"><img alt=\"Capwn\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"248\" src=\"/images/Capwn.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Capwn.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Capwn</div></div></div>\n<p>Capwn is a Hero first encountered in <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Capwn's Family Ratstaurant</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a> Level 3.  He and his gang are a Quest object.\n</p><p>Then he goes to hide in <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Sissirat's Safe House</a> off of Level 7, where he remains, heavily guarded, until <a href=\"/wiki/Sissirat\" title=\"Sissirat\">Sissirat</a> is destroyed and the key obtained.  Killing Ratphonse Capwn (again?) fulfills another Quest.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
